## Diagnostics

```bash
pnpm run doctor
pnpm run info
```

## Scripts

- `pnpm dev` - Start development servers from the root (includes contracts build/watch)
- `pnpm build` - Build applications
- `pnpm run db:setup` - Generate the Prisma client and apply development migrations
- `pnpm run doctor` / `pnpm run info` - Diagnose and describe the generated project
<% if (docker) { %>- `pnpm docker:up` / `pnpm docker:down` - Docker Compose

Run `pnpm install` at the project root before `docker compose build` if you used `--no-install` during create.
<% } %>

